### list indices
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices?v
Content-Type: application/json

### create index
PUT http://localhost:9200/my_locations2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "location": {
        "type": "geo_shape"
      }
    }
  }
}


### index a doc
POST http://localhost:9200/my_locations2/_doc/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Somewhere in Belgium",
  "location": {
    "type": "point",
    "coordinates": [150000, 170000],
    "crs": "http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/31370"
  }
}


### search all
POST http://localhost:9200/332f27a6b5abba0a9441f5d234f6623c/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match_all": {}
  }
}

### search
POST http://localhost:9200/332f27a6b5abba0a9441f5d234f6623c/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "filter": {
        "geo_distance": {
          "distance": "10km",
          "coord": {
            "lat": 50.82328287671103,
            "lon": 4.524313038010309
         }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}


### mu search
GET http://localhost/search/geometries/search?filter[:geo:coord]=50.8466414159896,4.501999194554501,1km
Accept: application/json 

